    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You elevate a single voice until it carries a whole room.</em></p><p>As a <strong>bonus action</strong>, choose one ally within <strong>12 squares</strong> who can hear you. Until the start of your next turn:</p><ul><li>The ally rerolls the lowest die on their next <strong>Diplomacy (Presence)</strong> or <strong>Intimidation (Presence)</strong> check.</li><li>If that check shifts a crowd, faction representative, or social tempo, your Domain gains <strong>+10 Soft Power marks</strong> for the next turn (once per scene).</li></ul><p>This represents you turning someone into the right voice at the right time.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
